# slug: ch85-worklist
# source: chapters/ch85.tex:124
# label: alg:ch85-worklist
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch85.tex:127
# caption: Run an affected-node rewrite worklist with stale-match protection.

REQUIRE valid IR, complete dependency neighborhood policy, resource budget
ENSURE valid rewritten IR and explicit fixed-point or incomplete status
enqueue initial candidates with version information
WHILE worklist nonempty and budget remains DO
  take candidate; revalidate its node and required analyses
  discover an admitted rewrite under the selected strategy
  IF a rewrite is selected THEN
    construct replacement; check invariants; commit change
    invalidate dependent facts and enqueue every affected neighborhood
  END IF
END WHILE
distinguish empty-worklist completion from resource exhaustion

